@HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### List heroes
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/heroes
Accept: application/json

### Top counter-picks for a hero (here Anti-Mage), ranked by sample-adjusted advantage; limit is 1-20
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/heroes/1/counters?limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Health: "Healthy" (200) when the database is reachable, "Unhealthy" (503) otherwise
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
